d in Windows 10 & 11), minimizing then restoring a window that has both a `size` and a `max_size` set will cause the window to shrink to the smallest size window possible.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes it by storing the width and height from `GetWindowRect()` and reading from that if the window is minimized. This is the exact same way we already solve the issue when reading from `GetClientRect()` in `window_get_size`.\r\n\r\n**Before**\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c311a54-4379-4388-91c5-00ae9c0a9083\r\n\r\n**After**\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6f693ac-7ab3-48a1-8cd1-e530447bc3e8\r\n\r\n**Minimum reproduction**\r\n\r\n[min-rep-resize_2025-11-08_20-39-42.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23430597/min-rep-resize_2025-11-08_20-39-42.zip)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","g